    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperbly located in the heart of Dublin 4, 1 Bayview are four light filled one bedroom apartments situated within a well-established development with many essential amenities on its doorstep. This is an excellent opportunity for an investor to acquire four apartments with spacious and well-appointed accommodation in a trendy central location.\n\nAll four apartments extend to between 36sq.m and 38 sq.m approx., each with well configured accommodation briefly comprising of a living/dning/kitchen, double bedroom and bathroom. The property also benefits from a communal rear garden with a store for each unit.\n\nIdeally positioned between Sandymount and Ringsend villages, the property enjoys close proximity to the city centre and Grand Canal Dock. Local amenities include Sandymount Strand, the Aviva Stadium, RDS, DART, and an excellent selection of shops, cafés and restaurants in Bath Avenue, Ballsbridge, Sandymount and the Docklands. The Port Tunnel, M50 and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible.\n\nThe area is well served by an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, along with a wide range of recreational amenities, parks, sports clubs, gyms and coastal walks close by."
      },
